      84.48,
      403.52,
      285.72,
      425.12
    ],
    "text": "Land Ministry Reference No.: 3/J/68/69/L/81/VE.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      426.56,
      286.43,
      505.75
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude* which is required for a public purpose:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      507.2,
      286.44,
      563.11
    ],
    "text": "The below mentioned land depicted as lot 02 in Preliminary Plan No. MR 729, located in the village of Hittetiya - East in Matara Divisional Secretariat Division, Matara District, Southern Province, has been acquired for the Matara Kirala Kele Project.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      64.56,
      576.36,
      286.44,
      685.0
    ],
    "text": "Schedule 1. Lot No. 2 Name of land: Modara Kella; Nature of land: Marsh; Original Owner of the land: Gunadasa Kula Samaranayake, No. 89, Lighthouse Road, Dondra; Extent: 7 acres, 1 Roods, 17 Perches,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      346.16,
      539.39,
      471.2
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands* on which a Servitude is to be acquired are here by required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Matara Divisional Secretariat, on the 18th day of March, 2016 at 10.30 a.m. and are here by requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 11th day of March, 2016 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      472.64,
      536.04,
      596.48
    ],
    "text": "RANJITH YAPA, Divisional Secretary, Matara. Divisional Secretariat, Matara, 20th February, 2016. 03 - 244",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
